      "content": "okay fine, no peroxide. but if i really cant go to the clinic today, what's the absolute best thing i can do right now to just seal it up so it stays clean? like is there a way to glue it shut or use a heavy ointment to block everything out until i can finish my work? i just need a way to handle this myself for now so it doesn't get worse.",
